    "label": "아이스티즈 (IST즈)",
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(50, 237, 253);\">250226 SIGNAL LIVE</span> featured a duet live by <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226);\">유빈</span> and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span>; at the time, the chemistry name was set to mean <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 149, 63);\">유빈</span> and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span>, whose MBTI types begin with IST. \r\nHowever, through <span style=\"color: rgb(219, 12, 116);\">250303 지우’s fromm</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\"> 지우</span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226);\">유빈</span>, and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span> said that while eating a late-night snack together, they would also add <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\">지우</span>, who loves iced tea (the drink) so much, into 아이스티즈, announced they would change it to a three-member chemistry name including <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 248, 0);\"> 지우</span>, and the three’s chemistry name became 아이스티즈. \r\nAlso, they newly set <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 227, 226);\">유빈</span> and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 171, 98);\">지연</span>’s chemistry name to 원플원즈."
  },
