    "label": "아라아라즈",
    "descriptionEn": "<span style=\"color: rgb(152, 242, 29); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">채연이</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\"> saw shorts related to the 아라아라 meme through a friend, became hooked, and told </span><span style=\"color: rgb(146, 0, 255); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">혜린</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">코토네</span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">, who shared the same room; it became an obsession and spread like a trend, and they named the room the “아라아라 Hawaii room.” Members belonging to that room are called </span><span style=\"color: rgb(231, 233, 234); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016);\">아라아라즈.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\">&nbsp;Later, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(82, 217, 187);\">하연이</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\"> joined Modasoop HAUS and the 아라아라 Hawaii room, becoming an additional member of 아라아라즈.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\">You can find more details through </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 116, 120);\">231115 SIGNAL LIVE</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224);\">.</span>"
