nd-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">,” a chemistry name created through </span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 174, 255); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">WAV fan voting</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, but after </span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118); background-color: rgb(13, 14, 18);\">마유</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> joined as </span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">S16</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, some began to misunderstand the chemistry name as one for </span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">마유</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">코토네</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">. For this reason, after </span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">마유</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">'s reveal, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">코토네</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">'s </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 66, 138); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">fromm</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> discussed the 마유네즈 chemistry name, but at the time she said it would not be changed. However, in January ’25, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 222, 0); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">코토네</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> said she would change this chemistry name to a three-person name including </span><span style=\"color: rgb(219, 12, 116); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">유연이</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\"> and </span><span style=\"color: rgb(254, 142, 118); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">마유</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">, and that she wants to set a new chemistry name with </span><span style=\"color: rgb(219, 12, 116); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">유연이</span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 224, 224); background-color: rgb(28, 29, 31);\">. </span></span>"
